	     BINDING_HEADER_MONKEDO and BINDING_NAME_MONKEDO_PICK, set in Core.lua.
	     category="ADDONS" files the key under Keybindings > AddOns (the game looks the name
	     up as a global string, ADDONS = "AddOns"). -->
	<Binding name="MONKEDO_PICK" header="MONKEDO" category="ADDONS">
		MonkeDo_Pick()
	</Binding>
</Bindings>
